# Suites and trials that the ESP32-S3_idf trial target does not run, each with its reason, in the form of
# ESP32-S3_raw.skip. That file applies to this target as well (TARGET_GOLDENS in ESP32-S3_idf.conf): only
# what differs for the guest of ESP-IDF is listed here.
timers_addition/current_time_plausible   target: a guest image is flashed, not loaded into RAM, so the loader does not set the wall clock; current_time answers milliseconds since start
